WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.620
The Qur'an says: We have
created every thing by measure.

2
00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:08.330
It also says: whosoever
will, let him believe,

3
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.600
and whosoever will, let him disbelieve.

4
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:12.890
So which is it?

5
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:17.680
Is everything measured out in advance,
or is each person free to choose?

6
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.270
And if God already knows
what you will choose,

7
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.340
are you still free, and still to blame?

8
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.920
In this mission, you will ask
where wrong choices come from,

9
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:30.110
starting with a story
of pride and testing.

10
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:33.040
Then you will see what
al-Qadr, God's decree,

11
00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:38.040
means for Muslims, and how Muslim
teachers have explained human choice.

12
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:42.680
Your mission: decide whether God's
knowledge leaves room for human freedom and

13
00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:43.390
blame.
